# JFM Blog Theme - Drupal 11 SDC Architecture

## Project Overview

Modern, accessible Drupal 11 blog theme using Single Directory Components (SDC). Zero dependencies. Vanilla CSS/JS only. Built as a reference implementation for teaching modern Drupal theming patterns.

## Core Philosophy

- Simple: No build process, no external dependencies
- Modern: SDC architecture, CSS Grid, semantic HTML5
- Accessible: WCAG 2.2 AA compliance by default
- Maintainable: Clear structure, inline documentation
- Shareable: Every line teaches a pattern

